    "synthesis_rationale": "The posterior of 0.58 results from combining two strong upward updates (CS presence and expansion) with some downward/moderate downward and neutral factors (norms/deterrence, attribution uncertainty). The updates are treated as partially correlated; calibration adjusts the net effect to a mid-high probability with a roughly 0.50–0.66 plausible range to May 1, 2026."
  }
}

